6:    if $x_{t-1}^{\text{SG}}(s_{i}, g_{m}) = 1$ and $R_{t}^{\text{SG}}(s_{i}, g_{m}) > 0$ then
7: $x_{t}^{\text{SG}}(s_{i}, g_{m}) \leftarrow 1$ ;
8: $n_{\text{st}}(s_{i}) \leftarrow n_{\text{st}}(s_{i}) + 1$ , $n_{\text{gr}}(g_{m}) \leftarrow n_{\text{gr}}(g_{m}) + 1$ ;
9: $R_{t}^{\text{SG}}(s_{i}, g_{m}) \leftarrow 0$ ;
